    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You have been trained balance <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> within yourself, holding the quaking power within you. As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>, you can grant yourself a bonus to your attack rolls equal to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> modifier (whichever is lower). However, while this effect is active, you suffer a penalty to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defenses\" title=\"Defenses\">Defenses</a> equal to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a>.<br><br>This effect lasts a number of rounds equal to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> modifier (minimum 1 round).",
